Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.45,0:07:12.16,Comment,,0,0,0,,{\fn@方正行楷_GBK\fs20\bord2\frz270\c&H2E4E72&\3c&H7EAFE3&\move(1324.445,243,320,243,18,4689)}距正宮\N100米
